lan_review/test_g7_blocking.py:1-20, 85-87` — Preserve 0.85 boundary, grade mapping, and rubric constraints. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/plan_review/test_t5c_grounding.py:1-23, 82-84` — Preserve grounding override, deduplication, demotion, and severity scoping. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/plan_review/test_2be7_whitespace_material.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_94a3_material_diff.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_criteria_blocking.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_det_criterion_gates.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_det_floor_module_seam.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_g7_blocking.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_t5c_grounding.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/plan_review/test_2be7_whitespace_material.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/plan_review/test_94a3_material_diff.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/plan_review/test_criteria_blocking.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/plan_review/test_det_criterion_